      "concepts": [
        "经营求财总论"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-00-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line1",
            "source_lines": [
              1,
              1
            ],
            "source_quote": "第一节 取用判断经验",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line3",
            "source_lines": [
              3,
              3
            ],
            "source_quote": "经营求财预测，一般以日干为求测之人，以时干为财或货物；以甲子戊为资本，以生门为利息；以值符为货主，值使为购货之人；以六合为经纪人，月干为同行竞争者；以生门所临之星为财星；以值符和景门为行情；以时干和值使门落宫为经营项目；以开、休、生落宫为得财方向；以生门落宫为得财数量；以开门为店铺、门面，以生门为房屋，以死门为地皮；以值符为物主或银行，以值使为借贷人；以值符为银行为放贷人；以天乙（值符下临地盘之星）为贷款人或借款人；以值符为债主；以天乙为欠债人，以伤门为讨债人，等等。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line5",
            "source_lines": [
              5,
              5
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门落旺宫，又得奇、得吉格，则得利大，相则平，休囚利微；如休囚又逢凶格，无利赔本；甲子戊与生门落空亡、反吟、墓绝，再有凶格凶神者，不仅不得财，反会招惹是非。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line7",
            "source_lines": [
              7,
              7
            ],
            "source_quote": "甲子戊和生门上乘吉星事更吉，乘凶星则含有凶的成分。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line9",
            "source_lines": [
              9,
              9
            ],
            "source_quote": "又可以地盘甲子戊上乘之干来判断得财数量。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line11",
            "source_lines": [
              11,
              11
            ],
            "source_quote": "得财时间：甲子戊与生门同落内盘为距离近、速度快，一内一外则迟，全在外则更迟、更远。如甲子戊与开门同宫，则得财迅速。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line13",
            "source_lines": [
              13,
              13
            ],
            "source_quote": "又以地盘时干宫的地支定应期，为得财之年、月、日、时。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section00-line15",
            "source_lines": [
              15,
              15
            ],
            "source_quote": "伏吟，则生门对冲之宫地支为应期。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-01",
