      "category": "role",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 22,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
      "concepts": [
        "交易求财"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-01-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section01-line17",
            "source_lines": [
              17,
              17
            ],
            "source_quote": "（1）交易求财",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section01-line19",
            "source_lines": [
              19,
              19
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以日干为买主，时干为卖主，六合为经纪人、中介人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section01-line21",
            "source_lines": [
              21,
              21
            ],
            "source_quote": "日干生时干利卖方；时干生日干利买方；日干克时干，买主不要；时干克日干，卖主不卖；六合生日干，经纪人向买主；六合生时干，经纪人向卖主；六合入墓或空亡，必有奸诈欺瞒之事；日干与时干比和，公平交易，也主成交；日干、时干有一空亡，交易不成。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-02",
      "title": "投资求财",
