              23,
              23
            ],
            "source_quote": "（2）投资求财",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section02-line25",
            "source_lines": [
              25,
              25
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以甲子戊为资本，以生门为利息。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section02-line27",
            "source_lines": [
              27,
              27
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门落宫得奇和吉格、吉星，生甲子戊落宫吉，必获倍利；比和，得中利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section02-line29",
            "source_lines": [
              29,
              29
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门宫克甲子戊宫，又得凶神凶格者，必赔本。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section02-line31",
            "source_lines": [
              31,
              31
            ],
            "source_quote": "甲子戊落宫生生门落宫，主添加资本仍可获利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section02-line33",
            "source_lines": [
              33,
              33
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门落墓绝之地（指月令与生门之关系），再有凶神凶格，必耗尽资本。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-03",
      "title": "买货求财",
      "category": "analysis",
      "line_start": 35,
      "line_end": 46,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
