            ],
            "source_quote": "（4）卖货求财",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line49",
            "source_lines": [
              49,
              49
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以值符为卖方，值使为买方。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line51",
            "source_lines": [
              51,
              51
            ],
            "source_quote": "值使乘奇门吉格生值符或二者比和，可以卖出。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line53",
            "source_lines": [
              53,
              53
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符生值使，或二者相克，则卖不出去。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line55",
            "source_lines": [
              55,
              55
            ],
            "source_quote": "又可以日干为卖方，以时干为货物；甲子戊为资本，生门为利息。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line57",
            "source_lines": [
              57,
              57
            ],
            "source_quote": "日干生时干，为人恋货，不肯卖；时干生日干，为货恋人，卖不出去。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line59",
            "source_lines": [
              59,
              59
            ],
            "source_quote": "日干克时干，虽想快速将货卖出去，但成交迟缓；时干克日干，卖得快。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line61",
            "source_lines": [
              61,
              61
            ],
            "source_quote": "卖货有利无利，只要时干宫（货物）生甲子戊或生门宫，则可获利；时干宫不生甲子戊或生门宫，或者二者相克，则无利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section04-line63",
            "source_lines": [
              63,
              63
            ],
            "source_quote": "时干宫乘凶神凶格来冲克日干宫者，必赔本（二、八宫不遇反吟，则按比和断；反吟，则按对冲断）。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
