          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line67",
            "source_lines": [
              67,
              67
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以生门为住宅，以死门为地皮，以值符为买房或卖房之人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line69",
            "source_lines": [
              69,
              69
            ],
            "source_quote": "生死二门乘三奇吉格，说明房屋和地皮好，如果生值符宫，对买主有利，买后可发达。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line71",
            "source_lines": [
              71,
              71
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果生死二门不得吉格，说明房屋和地皮一般或质量差，如果生值符宫，则对卖主有利，卖后发达。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line73",
            "source_lines": [
              73,
              73
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果二者比和，则主平安。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line75",
            "source_lines": [
              75,
              75
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果生死二门休囚无力，又乘凶神凶格，说明房屋和地皮不好，如果二门宫来克值符宫，则主买后破家败财；如果值符来生此二门落宫，则必因此宅产而破败不利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line77",
            "source_lines": [
              77,
              77
            ],
            "source_quote": "又可以日干为买主或卖主，以生门为房屋、以死门为地皮，看其二者之间的生克关系。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section05-line79",
            "source_lines": [
              79,
              79
            ],
            "source_quote": "还可以日干为买主或卖主，以时干为房屋或地皮，来看其二者之间的生克关系。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
