          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line83",
            "source_lines": [
              83,
              83
            ],
            "source_quote": "商场、门市、酒店、旅馆、餐厅等，包括开办工厂等坐地经商预测，一般均以日干为求测之人，开门为其商场、门市、工厂、酒店等的代表符号。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line85",
            "source_lines": [
              85,
              85
            ],
            "source_quote": "开门乘旺相之气带三奇、吉星、吉格、吉神来生日干落宫者，为大吉大利；比和者次吉。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line87",
            "source_lines": [
              87,
              87
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果开门入墓、空亡或反吟者，则未开者开不成，已开者可能停产或关门。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line89",
            "source_lines": [
              89,
              89
            ],
            "source_quote": "开门落宫乘凶神凶格来冲克日干宫者，必破耗折本，因开店而破财。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line91",
            "source_lines": [
              91,
              91
            ],
            "source_quote": "也可以日干为求测之人，以时干为店铺，看其二者的旺相休囚及其生克关系。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section06-line93",
            "source_lines": [
              93,
              93
            ],
            "source_quote": "又以时干为顾客，乘吉门吉格吉神和旺相之气，又与开门相生，则顾客多；反之，则顾客少。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-07",
      "title": "合伙求财",
      "category": "role",
      "line_start": 95,
      "line_end": 106,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
      "concepts": [
        "合伙求财"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-07-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line95",
            "source_lines": [
              95,
              95
            ],
            "source_quote": "（7）合伙求财",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line97",
            "source_lines": [
              97,
              97
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以日干为我方，时干为合伙之人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line99",
            "source_lines": [
              99,
              99
            ],
            "source_quote": "时干乘奇门吉格来生日干宫者，对我方有利；日干宫生时干宫者，对他方有利；日干与时干比和者，公平；时干宫克日干宫者对我不利；日干宫克时干宫者，对他不利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line101",
            "source_lines": [
              101,
              101
            ],
            "source_quote": "同时，生门宫生我则吉，克我则不吉。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line103",
            "source_lines": [
              103,
              103
            ],
            "source_quote": "又可以地盘日干为我方，以上乘天盘之干为合伙之人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section07-line105",
            "source_lines": [
              105,
              105
            ],
            "source_quote": "天盘之干生地盘日干者，对我方有利；地盘日干生天盘之干者，对他方有利；比和者公平；二者相克则不成，成则不顺利。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-08",
      "title": "贷款或借钱",
      "category": "role",
      "line_start": 107,
      "line_end": 124,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
      "concepts": [
        "贷款或借钱"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-08-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line107",
            "source_lines": [
              107,
              107
            ],
            "source_quote": "（8）贷款或借钱",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line109",
            "source_lines": [
              109,
              109
            ],
            "source_quote": "一般以值符为物主或银行，以值使为借贷之人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line111",
            "source_lines": [
              111,
              111
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符生值使，或值使克值符，可以借到或贷到；如果值符克值使，或值使生值符，则借贷不遂。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line113",
            "source_lines": [
              113,
              113
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符与值使有一方空亡，也主借贷不成。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line115",
            "source_lines": [
              115,
              115
            ],
            "source_quote": "又可以所往之方的天盘星与地盘星之间的生克关系论之。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line117",
            "source_lines": [
              117,
              117
            ],
            "source_quote": "天盘为动为客，为借贷之人；地盘为静为主，为物主或银行。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line119",
            "source_lines": [
              119,
              119
            ],
            "source_quote": "地盘星生天盘星者，必借给或贷给；二者比和，虽然肯借贷，但必迟疑；二星相克主不借，反惹羞辱。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line121",
            "source_lines": [
              121,
              121
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果天盘星所临之干入地盘墓库者，则物主吝啬，不肯借。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section08-line123",
            "source_lines": [
              123,
              123
            ],
            "source_quote": "所去借贷之方，如果遇空亡，则说明物主无钱或人不在，去了也借贷不成。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-09",
      "title": "放贷",
      "category": "role",
      "line_start": 125,
      "line_end": 140,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
      "concepts": [
        "放贷"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-09-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line125",
            "source_lines": [
              125,
              125
            ],
            "source_quote": "（9）放贷",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line127",
            "source_lines": [
              127,
              127
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符为银行为放贷人，天乙（值符落宫原地盘之星）为借贷人，生门为利息。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line129",
            "source_lines": [
              129,
              129
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符克天乙落宫吉，天乙克值符落宫凶。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line131",
            "source_lines": [
              131,
              131
            ],
            "source_quote": "天乙生值符落宫吉，值符生天乙落宫凶。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line133",
            "source_lines": [
              133,
              133
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门与天乙同克值符落宫，放出之款损失殆尽。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line135",
            "source_lines": [
              135,
              135
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门与天乙同生值符落宫，本息全还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line137",
            "source_lines": [
              137,
              137
            ],
            "source_quote": "生门与天乙有一生一克值符宫者，借出之款不能全还或迟还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section09-line139",
            "source_lines": [
              139,
              139
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果天乙落宫休囚无力，虽生值符宫，是无力偿还，结局是不全还或迟还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "business-section-10",
      "title": "讨债",
      "category": "role",
      "line_start": 141,
      "line_end": 168,
      "attribution": "《神奇之门》本节叙述者",
      "summary": "保留完整来源语境及具体条件；不能用语义相似度激活专业规则。",
      "concepts": [
        "讨债"
      ],
      "dataset": {
        "key": "business-section-10-source-reference",
        "rows": [
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line141",
            "source_lines": [
              141,
              141
            ],
            "source_quote": "（10）讨债",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line143",
            "source_lines": [
              143,
              143
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符为放债之人，天乙（值符下临地盘之星）为欠债人，伤门为讨债人。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line145",
            "source_lines": [
              145,
              145
            ],
            "source_quote": "伤门克天乙，讨债人实心实意去讨。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line147",
            "source_lines": [
              147,
              147
            ],
            "source_quote": "天乙克伤门，彼此争斗不服。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line149",
            "source_lines": [
              149,
              149
            ],
            "source_quote": "伤门与天乙同生值符，本息全能追回。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line151",
            "source_lines": [
              151,
              151
            ],
            "source_quote": "伤门与天乙同克值符，本息不还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line153",
            "source_lines": [
              153,
              153
            ],
            "source_quote": "伤门生值符，克天乙，能讨回。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line155",
            "source_lines": [
              155,
              155
            ],
            "source_quote": "伤门生天乙，克值符，讨不回。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line157",
            "source_lines": [
              157,
              157
            ],
            "source_quote": "天乙旺相克伤门，虽有能力，但不还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line159",
            "source_lines": [
              159,
              159
            ],
            "source_quote": "天乙休囚生伤门，虽有心还，而无力量，即使还，也还不全。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line161",
            "source_lines": [
              161,
              161
            ],
            "source_quote": "如果天乙乘庚辛来克值符，必有经官之事。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line163",
            "source_lines": [
              163,
              163
            ],
            "source_quote": "值符克天乙乘丁奇或景门落四宫（四宫杜门主执法机关）者，也有经官之事。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line165",
            "source_lines": [
              165,
              165
            ],
            "source_quote": "甲子戊会开门落内盘者，其债速还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          },
          {
            "key": "business-section10-line167",
            "source_lines": [
              167,
              167
            ],
            "source_quote": "天乙乘天蓬或玄武，又克值符宫者，欠债人存心不还。",
            "applicability_status": "reference_only",
            "automatic_role_binding": false,
            "automatic_prediction": false
          }
        ]
      }
